            "conclusion": "`regular` proves `WilsonRegularity (wilsonFamily C)`: continuity and gauge invariance of the insertions, finite stencils `(C.localSection v.1).stencil`, and the running law with slope `2*b0 > 0` uniformly in `p` via `zeroUp_bound`."
